   array['running','barbell','pullUpBar','kettlebell','box']::text[],
   'time',
   'Bowen honors Captain Jeffrey Bowen, 37, of Alexander, North Carolina, a 13-year veteran of the Asheville Fire Department assigned to Rescue 3. He was fatally injured on July 28, 2011, while fighting a four-alarm fire in a medical building.

You complete three rounds of an 800 m run, 7 deadlifts (275 lb / 185 lb), 10 burpee pull-ups, 14 single-arm kettlebell thrusters (53 lb / 35 lb), 7 on each arm, and 20 box jumps (24 in / 20 in). That is 2,400 m of running, 21 heavy deadlifts, 30 burpee pull-ups, 42 thrusters and 60 box jumps. With five different stations every round, it tests your engine as much as your strength.',
   '[{"name": "Run", "reps": "800 m", "tip": "Run at a pace you can hold for three rounds. Use it to recover from the box jumps."}, {"name": "Deadlifts", "reps": "7", "tip": "Heavy. Quick singles with a reset at the floor are fine.", "rx_men": "275 lb", "rx_women": "185 lb"}, {"name": "Burpee Pull-Ups", "reps": "10", "tip": "Do a burpee under the bar, jump up and do a pull-up with your chin over the bar."}, {"name": "Single-Arm Kettlebell Thrusters", "reps": "14", "tip": "7 on each arm. Hold the bell in the rack, squat and drive it overhead. Switch arms after 7.", "rx_men": "53 lb", "rx_women": "35 lb"}, {"name": "Box Jumps", "reps": "20", "tip": "Step down on every rep to save your legs for the next run.", "rx_men": "24 in", "rx_women": "20 in"}]'::jsonb,
   'Record your finish time.',
   '["Set up every station near the start of the run", "Singles on the deadlifts", "Keep the run pace steady all three rounds"]'::jsonb,
   '["Lay out the barbell, pull-up bar, kettlebell and box in a line so the transitions are short.", "On the deadlifts, take a breath and brace before each rep, and keep the bar against your legs.", "On the burpee pull-ups, jump into the pull-up to save your arms.", "For the single-arm thrusters, keep your elbow under the bell in the squat and your free arm out for balance.", "Let the first 800 m feel easy. The third round is the one that decides your time."]'::jsonb,
   'Lower the deadlift to 185 lb / 135 lb, use a 35 lb / 26 lb kettlebell or a dumbbell for the thrusters, and use a 20 in / 16 in box or step up. Replace burpee pull-ups with burpees and jumping pull-ups. Cut the runs to 400 m, or row 500 m instead.',
   '[{"question": "What is the Bowen workout?", "answer": "3 rounds for time of an 800 m run, 7 deadlifts (275 lb / 185 lb), 10 burpee pull-ups, 14 single-arm kettlebell thrusters (53 lb / 35 lb, 7 each arm) and 20 box jumps (24 in / 20 in)."}, {"question": "How many total reps are in Bowen?", "answer": "21 deadlifts, 30 burpee pull-ups, 42 single-arm kettlebell thrusters and 60 box jumps, plus 2,400 m of running."}, {"question": "How do the single-arm kettlebell thrusters work?", "answer": "Each round you do 14 thrusters with one kettlebell, 7 on one arm and then 7 on the other."}, {"question": "Who was Bowen?", "answer": "Captain Jeffrey Bowen, 37, of the Asheville Fire Department in North Carolina. He was fatally injured on July 28, 2011, while fighting a four-alarm fire."}]'::jsonb,
