   array['bodyweight']::text[],
   'time',
   'Brenton honors Field Training Officer Timothy Quinn Brenton, 39, of the Seattle Police Department. He was shot and killed in a drive-by shooting while on duty on Oct. 31, 2009.

You complete five rounds of a 100-foot bear crawl and a 100-foot standing broad jump, with 3 burpees after every 5 broad jumps. That adds up to 500 feet of bear crawling and 500 feet of broad jumps. CrossFit adds that if you have a 20 lb vest or body armor, you should wear it. No equipment is needed, but the crawling burns your shoulders and the jumps and burpees work your legs and lungs.',
   '[{"name": "Bear Crawls", "reps": "100 ft", "tip": "Hips low, knees just off the ground and small, quick steps."}, {"name": "Broad Jumps", "reps": "100 ft", "tip": "Swing your arms, jump forward from both feet and land softly. Jump from where your heels land."}, {"name": "Burpees", "reps": "3 after every 5 broad jumps", "tip": "Do them right where you land, then keep jumping."}]'::jsonb,
   'Record your finish time.',
   '["Mark out 100 feet before you start", "Count your broad jumps in fives", "Wear a 20 lb vest only if you have one"]'::jsonb,
   '["Measure 100 feet and mark both ends so every round is the same distance.", "On the bear crawl, keep your back flat and move opposite hand and foot together.", "Land each broad jump with soft knees and set your feet before the next one.", "Count jumps out loud so you know when the 3 burpees are due.", "Find a steady pace you can repeat for all five rounds."]'::jsonb,
   'Leave out the vest. Shorten each distance to 50 feet, or do three rounds. Replace bear crawls with an inchworm walk or a plank walk, and replace broad jumps with walking lunges. Use step-back burpees if jumping burpees are too much.',
   '[{"question": "What is the Brenton workout?", "answer": "5 rounds for time of a 100-foot bear crawl and a 100-foot standing broad jump, with 3 burpees after every 5 broad jumps. Wear a 20 lb vest or body armor if you have one."}, {"question": "How many burpees are in Brenton?", "answer": "It depends on how far you jump. You do 3 burpees after every 5 broad jumps, so longer jumps mean fewer burpees."}, {"question": "Do I need a vest for Brenton?", "answer": "No. CrossFit says to wear a 20 lb vest or body armor if you have one."}, {"question": "Who was Brenton?", "answer": "Field Training Officer Timothy Quinn Brenton, 39, of the Seattle Police Department. He was killed in the line of duty on Oct. 31, 2009."}]'::jsonb,
